{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451820/extras/7dfb4827a55f58c607c6180f18f11ead.poster.avif?t=1769115231\" width=634 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451820/extras/7dfb4827a55f58c607c6180f18f11ead.webm?t=1769115231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451820/extras/7dfb4827a55f58c607c6180f18f11ead.mp4?t=1769115231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brawl Tactics: Origins</strong> fuses deck-building roguelikes and the tactics RPG genre like never before - lead your units, collect valuable trinkets and cast powerful spells to ensure victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Roguelike essence</i></strong>: <strong>Every game is different!</strong> Make your way through maps with procedurally generated challenges. Choose a riskier or safer path, build a different deck, fight in different environments and obtain different trinkets while keeping the experience always fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Deck creation</i></strong>: <strong>Choose your arsenal!</strong> Decide from a wide assortment of actions and spells that complement each other to maximize your chances of success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Upgrade, upgrade, upgrade!</i></strong>: Obtain powerful trinkets that will greatly improve your deck, giving you new possibilities or reinforcing existing interactions. Add items to your cards, so that they become stronger, with new effects. Directly improve your units through the Forge and the events that you encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>A playstyle for everyone</i></strong>: Play with multiple classes, each with their strengths and weaknesses. Each class plays differently. <strong>Will you master them all?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Ascend!</i></strong>: Will you be able to succeed in <strong>Ascension 10</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>12 different classes</strong> to play with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>160+ cards</strong> to add to your decks! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>120+ trinkets</strong> to boost your power! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>40+ enemies</strong> to challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 challenges</strong> with unique twists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>61 achievements</strong> to conquer! </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Brawler Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2451820/45c47a8621eefd1ab38ef2550c008a70342ff301.jpg"},{"name":"Brawler Tactician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2451820/f9c22c053759be48ae1130bc8300785c212dae08.jpg"},{"name":"Brawler Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2451820/a03b704e4c1762ffec3dd79f67c563bf2df8e197.jpg"},{"name":"Brawler Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2451820/a1efbf2703cb2dbae9fd585fe6e8c3ac2024432a.jpg"},{"name":"Arcane Mage Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2451820/9ddc3fe3c54eac009e4eb5734564dae0d3354cd9.jpg"},{"name":"Arcane Mage Tactician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2451820/9afe94b2a4d7de566109bb991be91af6d69e40fc.jpg"},{"name":"Arcane Mage Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam